<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance Z2</name>
  <description>WARM-UP:
• 10min easy build @50-68% FTP

MAIN SET:
• 50min @66-75% FTP (RPE 3-4)
• Position: alternate every 30min — drops (aero) / hoods (power)
• Cadence: self-selected, comfortable endurance cadence

COOL-DOWN:
• 10min easy spin @45-68% FTP (Z1-Z2, RPE 2-3)

EXECUTION:
• Week 1/10, BASE phase — 10 weeks to Classic Gravel 100. Aerobic base building: easy riding builds mitochondrial density and fat oxidation, the foundation everything else rests on. Level 1: cadence and position focus — same structure, refine the execution.

NUTRITION: 30-60g carbs/hr.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.68"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="3000" Power="0.68"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.68" PowerHigh="0.45"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>